# Brigid, Clachan's Heart // Brigid, Doun's Mind. Turn 1: "whenever this creature enters ..., create a 1/1 green and white Kithkin
# creature token". Turn 3: "at the beginning of your first main phase, you may pay {G}. If you do, transform Brigid" - Mox Emerald pays it as the
# ability resolves and she becomes a 3/2 Kithkin Soldier (CR 701.27a); the front face's enters-or-transforms ability is not Doun's Mind's, so no
# second token. Doun's Mind "{T}: Add X {G} or X {W}, where X is the number of other creatures you control" counts the Kithkin token and the
# Ornithopter, not herself: tapped for white she adds {W}{W}. Turn 5: she pays {W} and transforms back (Mox Pearl), and "transforms into Brigid,
# Clachan's Heart" makes a second Kithkin token.

